{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.poster.avif?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.webm?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.mp4?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</strong> is a 1930s noir-inspired detective game with humanoid animal characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does Albert Wilde solve the strangest quantum mystery in a murder case? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out in this 6-7 hours silly and hilarious classic detective adventure tribute to the golden age of noir movies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/dea827a3e7c40a29ef0967b12ea797e9.webp?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Use your years of experience of interrogating and drinking at bars to chat with locals to solve a mystery. Rely on your cat-charisma to find the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/9287497e11fba62815f9022be897e273.webp?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Meet a cast of 27 interesting characters like a pole-dancing flamingo, a piggy lawyer, a pissed-off moose bookie, an out-of-tune sheep singer, a FAMOUS SCIENTIST and the dangerous crocodile gang. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/64efed43512bc1ab0eb45738d9859a1b.webp?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Albert Wilde is down on his luck. He\u2019s broke, he\u2019s friendless, he can\u2019t get a girl, and his landlord won\u2019t let him pee on the office wall anymore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.poster.avif?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.webm?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.mp4?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q &amp; A</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is the game a combination of different genres?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, it\u2019s hard to define <i>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</i> by a single genre, as we tend to blend multiple elements in our projects. This game is a fusion of comedy, film noir, detective mystery, science fiction, and narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you describe the genre from a technical perspective?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a technical perspective, you could describe it as something between a walking simulator and an interactive novel, with a strong emphasis on comedy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this game a kind of \u2018whodunnit\u2019 murder mystery game?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s less of a typical &quot;whodunnit&quot; and more of an origin story\u2014showing how Albert Wilde evolves from a Private Investigator (P.I.) to a Quantum Private Investigator.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Case","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/b463fc9f83e6ea85b1a261ae3117b47b37c1c5c9.jpg"},{"name":"Dance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/5ff5bb2c92fdcad12e921b72633e9cb605dc0f89.jpg"},{"name":"The Sewers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/095fa41e57aef18dcaf3351de09cbfd77e103493.jpg"},{"name":"Back Cover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/7c55f9ae6c783071ad6e0458e2ddbc73c4812b4b.jpg"},{"name":"The Password","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/dc45dc2276e5a253a59ff280baf01bb396111dea.jpg"},{"name":"Scales","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/a8471e2b07c8ecc06955c3b49d6ea0d8fdc91fcc.jpg"},{"name":"The Archives","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/bcfd3ba8dea93de1d994a3160a333c15601a70dc.jpg"},{"name":"4666","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/d770b0d7754e7f7b3e3c8362212b3658f974100d.jpg"},{"name":"The Diary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/5f39afe40e3c9631bf95de3e2133d4b1fbe80a43.jpg"},{"name":"Who did it?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1810670/37c4d8b42b45788bf9393ebd0ae02190c75ab485.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1810670?t=1757097191","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1810670?t=1757097191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/6eacf869fc688fe0618431bb8b19fc48c842773d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757097191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/6eacf869fc688fe0618431bb8b19fc48c842773d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757097191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Unity's Creator Spotlight</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Unity\u2019s Creator Spotlight on YouTube on Thursday, January 30th, at 6 PM CET!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Detective Albert Wilde will be discussed by Maria, Andreas, and Jackson as we dive into the technical and creative elements of the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.poster.avif?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.webm?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.mp4?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</strong> is a 1930s noir-inspired detective game with humanoid animal characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does Albert Wilde solve the strangest quantum mystery in a murder case? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out in this 6-7 hours silly and hilarious classic detective adventure tribute to the golden age of noir movies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/dea827a3e7c40a29ef0967b12ea797e9.webp?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Use your years of experience of interrogating and drinking at bars to chat with locals to solve a mystery. Rely on your cat-charisma to find the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/9287497e11fba62815f9022be897e273.webp?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Meet a cast of 27 interesting characters like a pole-dancing flamingo, a piggy lawyer, a pissed-off moose bookie, an out-of-tune sheep singer, a FAMOUS SCIENTIST and the dangerous crocodile gang. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/64efed43512bc1ab0eb45738d9859a1b.webp?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=60 /></span>Albert Wilde is down on his luck. He\u2019s broke, he\u2019s friendless, he can\u2019t get a girl, and his landlord won\u2019t let him pee on the office wall anymore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.poster.avif?t=1757097191\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.webm?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.mp4?t=1757097191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Q &amp; A</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is the game a combination of different genres?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, it\u2019s hard to define <i>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</i> by a single genre, as we tend to blend multiple elements in our projects. This game is a fusion of comedy, film noir, detective mystery, science fiction, and narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you describe the genre from a technical perspective?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a technical perspective, you could describe it as something between a walking simulator and an interactive novel, with a strong emphasis on comedy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this game a kind of \u2018whodunnit\u2019 murder mystery game?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s less of a typical &quot;whodunnit&quot; and more of an origin story\u2014showing how Albert Wilde evolves from a Private Investigator (P.I.) to a Quantum Private Investigator.</p>","developers":["beyondthosehills"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/header.jpg?t=1757097191","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1810670/812468/dca09884ce8efdc620486ba27b743ba9527f7190/1750737290/dash_av1